BROWSER OS ARCHITECTURE SPEC (v1.0)
========================================================================
OVERVIEW

This system is a browser-native operating environment built on four core principles:

Isolation → prevent cross-contamination between execution contexts
Ephemeral Execution → everything is disposable by default
Obfuscation → prevent fingerprinting, tracking, and correlation
Virtualization → treat every tab, workspace, and site as a sandboxed compute unit
