FINAL SYSTEM SUMMARY
========================================================================

This Browser OS is composed of five integrated security domains:

1. ISOLATION LAYER

Prevents cross-contamination between tabs, workspaces, and processes.

2. VIRTUALIZATION LAYER

Treats every browsing context as a microVM-level compute unit.

3. OBFUSCATION LAYER

Prevents fingerprinting, tracking, and correlation.

4. ANONYMITY NETWORK LAYER

Routes traffic through Tor/I2P/Nym-style systems.

5. EPHEMERAL STORAGE LAYER

Ensures no persistent forensic footprint remains.
